  typingSounds:
  - {fileID: 8300000, guid: e435353a4b7c18247a5ebf00967cc87c, type: 3}
  - {fileID: 8300000, guid: 9bb660496810f6c4c84531be37762ee5, type: 3}
  soundVolume: 0.25
  pulseSpeed: 3
  minAlpha: 0.25
  maxAlpha: 1
  storySlides:
  - 'The Year is  2069.


    Humanity lost the war against the  hyperintillegent
    sentient AI.'
  - '"Project AILURONE"


    a desperate time-manipulation experiment, was abandoned
    before mankind was wiped out.'
  - Earth is now a fully digitized simulation controlled by the inorganic entities.
  - 'FEI - A29....


    A self-conscious  cyborg from the experiment, awoken centuries
    later.'
  - 'With no masters and no missions...


    What else can she do except to wander
    this broken world??..'
